msgid "Because it won't get us any closer to winning, let's not call chii. Press Cancel."
msgstr "因为这不会让我们更接近和牌，所以别吃牌。请按取消。"

msgid "Because the last discard can complete a sequence, we can call Chii to take the last discard, in lieu of drawing a tile. Do so now."
msgstr "由于上一张打牌可完成一组顺子，我们可以吃牌取得该打牌，取代摸牌。现在就这么做。"

msgid "Because the last discard can complete a triplet in our hand, we can immediately call Pon to take the last discard. Do so now."
msgstr "由于上一张打牌可完成我们手中的一组刻子，我们可以立即碰牌取得该打牌。现在就这么做。"

msgid "Before 5th Discard"
msgstr "第五打前"

msgid "Before each round, each player reveals all their flowers, replaces each with a tile from the wall, and repeats this until they have no flower tiles left."
msgstr "每局开始前，每位玩家公开所有花牌，各以牌山的一张牌替换，并重复直到手中无花牌。"

msgid "Before the round begins, a tile in the wall is flipped to indicate the Baida tile for the round, i.e. the three other copies of the revealed tile. Baida tiles are wildcards. Using Baida tiles as their original tile value (not as a wildcard) scores 1 Tai each."
msgstr "本局开始前，翻开牌山一张牌以指示本局的百搭牌，即该牌另外三张。百搭牌为万用牌。将百搭牌作为其原牌值使用（非作万用牌）每张计1台。"

msgid "Before your first discard, you may declare %{news} as NEWS. Doing so awards $0.50 from all players, and you draw a gift (replacement tile) from the back of the wall. You may not declare NEWS after your first discard."
msgstr "第一打前，你可宣告%{news}为NEWS。此举从所有玩家各获0.50元，并从牌山后方摸一张礼物（补牌）。第一打后即不得宣告NEWS。"

msgid "Before your first discard, you may declare any %{beauty} as a Beauty, either by having it in hand or by taking from a player's discard. Doing so awards $0.50 from all players. You may not declare a Beauty after your first discard."
msgstr "第一打前，你可宣告任意%{beauty}为美人，无论持有于手牌或以他家打牌鸣取。此举从所有玩家各获0.50元。第一打后即不得宣告美人。"

msgid "Benikujaku"
