msgstr "发出挑战消耗两枚初始挑战代币之一。"

msgid "It doesn't make sense to defend this early in MCR, so early flowers are always declared for a replacement tile. Do so now."
msgstr "在MCR中这么早就防守并不合理，故早期花牌一律宣告以换取补牌。现在就这么做。"

msgid "It is possible to customize the color of the table using the \"Tablecloth Color\" and \"Tile Color\" mods in Room Settings."
